KICAD 10.0.4 - SHORTCUTS AND ACTIONS REFERENCE
====================================================================
Windows/Linux default PC-keyboard notation.
Important: KiCad allows custom hotkeys. Ctrl+F1 shows the actual list in your installation.
The official online 10.0 manual currently states it is based on KiCad 10.0.5, so use Ctrl+F1 for exact 10.0.4 local confirmation.


PROJECT MANAGER
---------------
Ctrl+N                   | New Project                                | Create a new project
Ctrl+T                   | New Project from Template                  | Create a project from a template
Ctrl+O                   | Open Project                               | Open an existing project
Ctrl+E                   | Schematic Editor                           | Open/edit schematic
Ctrl+L                   | Symbol Editor                              | Open/edit symbols
Ctrl+P                   | PCB Editor                                 | Open/edit PCB
Ctrl+F                   | Footprint Editor                           | Open/edit footprints
Ctrl+G                   | Gerber Viewer                              | View Gerber outputs
Ctrl+B                   | Image Converter                            | Convert bitmap images to schematic/PCB components
Ctrl+Y                   | Drawing Sheet Editor                       | Edit drawing sheet and title block
Ctrl+M                   | Plugin and Content Manager                 | Manage KiCad/third-party packages

COMMON
------
Ctrl+W                   | Close                                      | Close the current editor/window
Ctrl+Q                   | Quit                                       | Quit KiCad/editor
Ctrl+F1                  | List Hotkeys                               | Show current hotkey table and assignable commands
Ctrl+,                   | Preferences                                | Show preferences
Ctrl+S                   | Save                                       | Save changes
Ctrl+Shift+S             | Save As                                    | Save current document to another location
Ctrl+N                   | New                                        | Create a new document
Ctrl+O                   | Open                                       | Open an existing document
Ctrl+P                   | Print                                      | Print current document
Ctrl+Z                   | Undo                                       | Undo last edit
Ctrl+Y                   | Redo                                       | Redo last undone edit
Ctrl+C                   | Copy                                       | Copy selected items
Ctrl+Shift+C             | Copy as Text                               | Copy selected items as text
Ctrl+X                   | Cut                                        | Cut selected items
Ctrl+V                   | Paste                                      | Paste clipboard items
Ctrl+Shift+V             | Paste Special                              | Paste with options
Ctrl+D                   | Duplicate                                  | Duplicate selected items
Del                      | Delete                                     | Delete selected items
Ctrl+F                   | Find                                       | Find items/text
Ctrl+Alt+F               | Find and Replace                           | Find and replace
F3                       | Find Next                                  | Find next match
Shift+F3                 | Find Previous                              | Find previous match
Ctrl+Shift+F3            | Find Next Marker                           | Go to next checker marker
Ctrl+G                   | Search Panel                               | Show/hide search panel
Ctrl+A                   | Select All                                 | Select all items on screen
Ctrl+Shift+A             | Unselect All                               | Clear selection
Ctrl+Shift+M             | Measure Tool                               | Measure distance between points
F1                       | Zoom In at Cursor                          | Zoom in at cursor
F2                       | Zoom Out at Cursor                         | Zoom out at cursor
F4                       | Center on Cursor                           | Center the view on cursor
F5                       | Refresh                                    | Refresh/redraw view
Ctrl+F5                  | Zoom to Selection Area                     | Zoom to a dragged area
Home                     | Zoom to Fit                                | Fit worksheet/objects
Ctrl+Home                | Zoom to All Objects                        | Fit all objects
Space                    | Reset Local Coordinates                    | Reset relative coordinate origin
Up                       | Cursor Up                                  | Move cursor one grid step up
Down                     | Cursor Down                                | Move cursor one grid step down
Left                     | Cursor Left                                | Move cursor one grid step left
Right                    | Cursor Right                               | Move cursor one grid step right
Ctrl+Up                  | Cursor Up Fast                             | Move cursor faster up
Ctrl+Down                | Cursor Down Fast                           | Move cursor faster down
Ctrl+Left                | Cursor Left Fast                           | Move cursor faster left
Ctrl+Right               | Cursor Right Fast                          | Move cursor faster right
Shift+Up                 | Pan Up                                     | Pan view upward
Shift+Down               | Pan Down                                   | Pan view downward
Shift+Left               | Pan Left                                   | Pan view left
Shift+Right              | Pan Right                                  | Pan view right
Alt+1                    | Fast Grid 1                                | Switch to fast grid 1
Alt+2                    | Fast Grid 2                                | Switch to fast grid 2
Alt+4                    | Cycle Fast Grid                            | Cycle fast grids
N                        | Next Grid                                  | Switch to next grid
Shift+N                  | Previous Grid                              | Switch to previous grid
H                        | Inactive Layer View 3-state                | Cycle normal/dim/hidden
Shift+S                  | Toggle Snapping Layer Scope                | Toggle active/all visible layer snapping
Ctrl+U                   | Units                                      | Switch metric/imperial units
Ctrl+Shift+G             | Grid Overrides                             | Enable item-specific grid overrides
Alt+3                    | 3D Viewer                                  | Open 3D Viewer
D                        | Show Datasheet                             | Open selected component datasheet
End                      | Finish                                     | Finish current tool/operation

