Ctrl+Shift+E             | Edit Library Symbol                        | Open library symbol in Symbol Editor
Ctrl+E                   | Edit with Symbol Editor                    | Open selected symbol in Symbol Editor
`                        | Highlight Net                              | Highlight net under cursor
Ctrl+Shift+F             | Import Graphics                            | Import a 2D drawing file
Shift+Space              | Line Mode - Next Angle                     | Cycle wire/bus angle snapping mode
Tab                      | Next Net Item                              | Select next item on current net
Shift+Tab                | Previous Net Item                          | Select previous item on current net
S                        | Draw Hierarchical Sheets                   | Place hierarchical sheet
Z                        | Wire to Bus Entry                          | Place wire-to-bus entry
Shift+B                  | Place Design Block                         | Add selected design block to sheet
Ctrl+L                   | Place Global Label                         | Place global label
H                        | Place Hierarchical Label                   | Place hierarchical label
J                        | Place Junction                             | Place junction
L                        | Place Net Label                            | Place local net label
Q                        | Place No-Connect Flag                      | Place no-connect flag
P                        | Place Power Symbol                         | Place power symbol
T                        | Draw Text                                  | Place text
A                        | Place Symbol                               | Place schematic symbol
B                        | Draw Bus                                   | Draw bus
I                        | Draw Line                                  | Draw graphic line
W                        | Draw Wire                                  | Draw wire
/                        | Switch Segment Posture                     | Change current segment posture
Backspace                | Undo Last Segment                          | Walk back one drawn segment
C                        | Unfold from Bus                            | Break a wire out of a bus
O                        | Autoplace Fields                           | Run automatic field placement
F                        | Edit Footprint                             | Edit footprint assignment
U                        | Edit Reference Designator                  | Edit symbol reference
V                        | Edit Value                                 | Edit symbol value
X                        | Mirror Horizontally                        | Flip selected items left/right
Y                        | Mirror Vertically                          | Flip selected items top/bottom
E                        | Properties                                 | Edit selected item properties
Ins                      | Repeat Last Item                           | Repeat/duplicate last placed item
R                        | Rotate Counterclockwise                    | Rotate selected item counterclockwise
Shift+R                  | Rotate Clockwise                           | Rotate selected item clockwise
