PgDn                     | Next Sheet                                 | Move to next sheet
PgUp                     | Previous Sheet                             | Move to previous sheet
Alt+Left                 | Navigate Back                              | Go backward in sheet navigation history
Alt+Right                | Navigate Forward                           | Go forward in sheet navigation history
Alt+Backspace            | Leave Sheet                                | Display parent sheet
Alt+Up                   | Navigate Up                                | Navigate up one hierarchy level
Ctrl+N                   | New Analysis Tab                           | Create a simulator analysis tab
Ctrl+O                   | Open Workbook                              | Open saved simulator workbook
Shift+P                  | Probe Schematic                            | Add simulator probe
R                        | Run Simulation                             | Run simulation
Ctrl+S                   | Save Workbook                              | Save simulator workbook
Ctrl+Shift+S             | Save Workbook As                           | Save simulator workbook elsewhere
Shift+T                  | Add Tuned Value                            | Select a simulator value to tune
F8                       | Update PCB from Schematic                  | Push schematic changes to PCB

PCB EDITOR
----------
Ctrl+T                   | Create Array                               | Create an item/footprint array
Ctrl++                   | Switch Track to Next Layer                 | Switch routed track to next enabled copper layer
Ctrl+-                   | Switch Track to Previous Layer             | Switch routed track to previous enabled copper layer
{                        | Decrease Layer Opacity                     | Make current layer more transparent
}                        | Increase Layer Opacity                     | Make current layer less transparent
PgDn                     | B.Cu                                       | Switch to back copper layer
B                        | Fill All Zones                             | Update all copper zone fills
Ctrl+B                   | Unfill All Zones                           | Remove all copper zone fills
4                        | Decrease Tuning Amplitude                  | Decrease tuning pattern amplitude
3                        | Increase Tuning Amplitude                  | Increase tuning pattern amplitude
2                        | Decrease Tuning Spacing                    | Decrease tuning pattern spacing
1                        | Increase Tuning Spacing                    | Increase tuning pattern spacing
F8                       | Update PCB from Schematic                  | Update PCB from schematic

