F                        | Flip Board                                 | Flip board view
Home                     | Home View                                  | Return to home view/zoom
Down                     | Move Board Down                            | Move board down
Left                     | Move Board Left                            | Move board left
Right                    | Move Board Right                           | Move board right
Up                       | Move Board Up                              | Move board up
Space                    | Set Pivot                                  | Set rotation pivot point
Shift+R                  | Rotate Z Clockwise                         | Rotate around Z clockwise
R                        | Rotate Z Counterclockwise                  | Rotate around Z counterclockwise
Shift+Y                  | View Back                                  | Front/back orthogonal view: back
Shift+Z                  | View Bottom                                | Bottom orthogonal view
Y                        | View Front                                 | Front orthogonal view
Shift+X                  | View Left                                  | Left orthogonal view
X                        | View Right                                 | Right orthogonal view
Z                        | View Top                                   | Top orthogonal view

